# No environment variables are required to unzip the data, clean it,
# build features, train the model, calibrate, evaluate on the holdout,
# or export the site data artifact -- every step in this repo runs from
# the local Kaggle download and local files only.
#
# This repo does not call out to any cloud service. Nothing is deployed
# and no file on giggitai.com is touched by this repo (standing rule).
